v 3
d netcalc: directed edge weights from a panel of ordered node pairs
d
d Author: Necmi TALAY
d Support: https://github.com/aggilitas/stata-networks/issues
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260913
d
d Turns a long panel of ordered node pairs and periods into a
d panel of directed edge weights, ready for a fixed-effects
d estimator. Three templates: interaction, flow and attribute,
d each with an optional split into subnets.
d
d Requires: Stata version 16 or higher (for frame support)
d
f code/network_calc.ado
f code/network_calc.sthlp
f code/_netcalc_interaction.ado
f code/_netcalc_flow.ado
f code/_netcalc_attribute.ado
f code/_netcalc_join.ado
f code/_netcalc_aggregate.ado
f tests/network_calc_cert.do
